            },
            {
              "description": "Space between destinations and direct children of the top/bottom regions in CSS pixels; zero is valid and explicit values win. Defaults to Density gap-md for icons, Density layout-gap-sm when labels are visible (twice gap-md at current stops).",
              "name": "itemGap",
